  "notes": {
    "satavahana": {
      "en": "Partial eastern/southern Deccan source: Amaravati is covered but Paithan is omitted. The 225 cutoff precedes the Ikshvaku rise; Satavahana chronology is approximate. The repeated 300/400 donor labels are rejected.",
      "zh": "来源仅涵盖德干东部与南部的一部分，包含阿摩罗婆提，却遗漏波坦。225年前截止是为避开甘蔗王朝兴起；百乘年代属约数。不采用原资料300／400年的重复标签。"
    },
    "pallava": {
      "en": "Selected Kanchi-centered reference, stopped before late ninth-century Chola expansion. This is not a claim that every Pallava line ended in 880; the Met chart and Harvard chronology differ on the dynasty span.",
      "zh": "精选以建志为中心的参照，在九世纪后期朱罗扩张前截止；不表示帕拉瓦所有支系均于880年终结。大都会博物馆图表与哈佛编年对王朝跨度记载有别。"
    },
    "chalukya-badami": {
      "en": "The early Badami line is distinct from the later Kalyani Chalukyas. The 753 handoff uses the Rashtrakuta imperial phase, not an unchanged Chalukya empire.",
      "zh": "早期巴达米支系与后期卡利亚尼遮娄其分开呈现；753年起改用罗湿陀罗拘陀帝国分期，不延用同一遮娄其帝国。"
    },
    "rashtrakuta": {
      "en": "The central imperial phase ends before the 973 Kalyani Chalukya succession. Residual Rashtrakuta rulers continued later; 973 is not the disappearance of every lineage.",
      "zh": "帝国中心分期在973年卡利亚尼遮娄其继起前截止；罗湿陀罗拘陀残余统治者延续更晚，973年并非所有支系消失之年。"
    },
    "chalukya-kalyani": {
      "en": "The window begins with Taila II in 973 and stops before the circa-1190 partition. Residual later rulers are not a basis for carrying this whole outline forward.",
      "zh": "窗口始于973年泰拉二世，在约1190年分裂前截止；晚期残余统治者的存在不足以把整片轮廓向后延伸。"
    },
    "pala": {
      "en": "Bengal/Bihar Pala reference, separate from the Pala rulers of Kamarupa. Later Pala/Sena overlaps require a different geography; the premature 700 and problematic 1100 donor entries are withheld.",
      "zh": "此为孟加拉／比哈尔波罗王朝参照，与迦摩缕波同名王朝分开。晚期波罗与犀那并存需另核地理；不采用过早的700年及有问题的1100年来源条目。"
    },
    "gurjara-pratihara": {
      "en": "Selected northern phase only. The 1000 donor labeled Pratihara is displaced eastward and misses Kanauj, so it is withheld rather than extended into the eleventh century.",
      "zh": "仅选取北部分期；原资料1000年标为波罗提诃罗的轮廓偏东且遗漏曲女城，因此暂不采用，也不据此延伸到十一世纪。"
    },
    "delhi-sultanate": {
      "en": "Northern selected reference, not all South Asia. The 1200 donor predates the sultanate, and the 1400 donor incorrectly covers the Vijayanagara/Hampi area after regional fragmentation; both are withheld.",
      "zh": "仅为精选北部参照，不代表全部南亚。原资料1200年早于苏丹国建立，1400年又在区域分裂后覆盖毗奢耶那伽罗／亨比地区，均暂不采用。"
    },
    "vijayanagara": {
      "en": "Selected mature kingdom reference stops before the 1565 Talikota defeat. Successor courts continued, so the map cutoff is not the extinction of the dynasty or culture; the unchanged 1600 donor is withheld.",
      "zh": "精选王国盛期参照在1565年塔利科塔战败前截止。后继宫廷仍延续，因此着色截止不表示王朝或文化消失；暂不采用原资料1600年未变的轮廓。"
    },
    "polonnaruwa": {
      "en": "Explicit component reassignment: the whole Sri Lanka island component of the licensed 1000 Chola outline is reused only for the independent Polonnaruwa phase from circa 1070 to 1199. It does not appear at source year 1000. This is an island-scale reference, not a surveyed postwar frontier; no speculative northern Chola frontier is drawn for 993–1016.",
      "zh": "明确重分配来源组件：将获许可的1000年朱罗轮廓中整座斯里兰卡岛的组件，仅用于约1070—1199年独立后的波隆纳鲁沃分期，不在轮廓来源年份1000年显示。此为岛屿尺度参照，不是战后实测边界；也不为993—1016年绘制推测的朱罗北部疆界。"
    },
    "aksum": {
      "en": "Selected northern Horn/Red Sea reference includes Aksum. UNESCO dates the kingdom to the first–eighth centuries; the source does not establish its maximum reach into Arabia or all later Ethiopian states.",
      "zh": "精选非洲之角北部／红海地区参照包含阿克苏姆。联合国教科文组织将王国定于一至八世纪；此轮廓不确立其在阿拉伯半岛的最大范围，也不代表此后所有埃塞俄比亚政权。"
    },
    "wagadu-transition": {
      "en": "The donor alias Ghana is retained, but the display is a regional transition, not an independent Ghana or unified Soso empire. The Met dates Soso absorption of much of Ghana circa 1180–1230 and Mali emergence circa 1230–1235. Traditional claims of a decisive 1076 conquest are not treated as a settled total collapse.",
      "zh": "保留原资料Ghana别名，但显示的是区域转变，不是独立的加纳帝国或统一索索帝国。大都会博物馆将索索吸纳加纳大部定于约1180—1230年，马里兴起约1230—1235年。不将传统1076年征服说视为已证实的全面灭亡。"
    },
    "kanem": {
      "en": "Early Kanem/Lake Chad reference, including the Njimi vicinity. The later 1300–1500 donor outline is displaced toward the Gulf of Guinea and omits Njimi; it is rejected. The later Bornu court shift is not reconstructed from this early outline.",
      "zh": "早期加涅姆／乍得湖参照包含恩吉米附近。原资料1300—1500年轮廓偏向几内亚湾且遗漏恩吉米，故不采用；也不以早期轮廓重建后来的博尔努宫廷迁移。"
    },
    "ethiopia": {
      "en": "A regional reference, not uniform imperial administration. Early Solomonic layers stop before the 1531–1543 Adal war. Gondarine court context starts in 1636; the 1769–1854 phase represents fragmented highland principalities. From 1855 the label reflects renewed imperial consolidation. The 1868 British expedition did not annex Ethiopia; later Menelik-era expansion is not inferred.",
      "zh": "区域参照不表示均匀帝国行政。所罗门王朝早期图层在1531—1543年阿达尔战争前截止；贡德尔宫廷背景始于1636年，1769—1854年分期表示高原诸侯割据，1855年起名称反映皇权重建。1868年英国远征并未吞并埃塞俄比亚，也不据此推断后来的孟尼利克时期扩张。"
    },
    "benin": {
      "en": "Edo kingdom centered on Benin City, distinct from today’s Republic of Benin. The 1500 source is a mature court/Delta-to-Lagos regional reference. The 1878 donor omits Benin City and is withheld; this batch leaves that later map gap visible. The 1897 conquest did not end Edo culture or the continuing royal institution.",
      "zh": "此为以贝宁城为中心的埃多王国，与今日贝宁共和国不同。1500年来源是成熟宫廷／尼日尔三角洲至拉各斯的区域参照；1878年来源遗漏贝宁城，暂不采用，保留该后期地图缺口。1897年征服并未终结埃多文化或延续的王室制度。"
    },
    "oyo": {
      "en": "Selected Yoruba imperial sphere, including subordinate relationships rather than uniform control. The source is stopped before nineteenth-century imperial disintegration; 1830 is a conservative eligibility cutoff, not a precise extinction date. The 1815 donor is wrongly located over Dahomey and the late 1878 imperial label is rejected.",
      "zh": "精选约鲁巴帝国联系圈，包含附属关系而非均匀控制。在十九世纪帝国瓦解前截止；1830年为保守的资料适用界限，并非精确灭亡年代。原资料1815年轮廓误置在达荷美地区，1878年的晚期帝国标签亦不采用。"
    },
    "dahomey": {
      "en": "Abomey-centered Dahomey is distinct from Edo Benin. Expansion, warfare and coerced enslavement underlie this regional sphere. Earlier dependence on Oyo is not erased by giving it a separate reference. A heritage site’s 1625–1900 royal sequence does not prove unchanged independence or borders through 1900.",
      "zh": "以阿波美为中心的达荷美与埃多贝宁分开；其区域联系圈涉及扩张、战争与强迫奴役。单独着色并不抹去早期对奥约的依附。遗产资料1625—1900年的王室序列不证明一直保持独立或边界不变。"
    },
    "great-zimbabwe-region": {
      "en": "A state-center and interaction region, not a demonstrated single frontier. The city grew from the eleventh century and its capital role was abandoned circa 1450. Later Torwa/Mutapa polities are not one unchanged Great Zimbabwe empire; the 1000/1100 donor empire shapes are withheld.",
      "zh": "此为政治中心与交往区域，并非已证实的单一疆界。城市自十一世纪成长，约1450年放弃都城职能。后来的托尔瓦／穆塔帕政权不视为未变的大津巴布韦帝国；不采用原资料1000／1100年的帝国轮廓。"
    },
    "funan-region": {
      "en": "Lower Mekong trading polities, not a modern country. The transition to Zhenla/Chenla is dated broadly 500–600 and its political relationship to later Khmer power remains unresolved. The 550 cutoff is an editorial transition gate, not an exact fall date; the late 600 donor is withheld.",
      "zh": "湄公河下游贸易政体，并非现代国家。向真腊转变宽泛定于500—600年，与后来高棉政权的政治关系仍未解决。550年是编辑选取的转变界限，不是精确灭亡年；不采用偏晚的600年扶南来源。"
    },
    "dvaravati-region": {
      "en": "A network of Mon cultural centers, not one demonstrated sovereign kingdom. Met gives roughly 500–900 and the Smithsonian chronology 550–990. The conservative display uses selected 550–989 references; it does not carry the 1000 donor forward as an independent Dvaravati state.",
      "zh": "孟人文化中心网络，并非已证实的单一主权王国。大都会博物馆约定于500—900年，史密森编年为550—990年；此处保守选取550—989年参照，不把原资料1000年的轮廓延续为独立堕罗钵底国家。"
    },
    "champa": {
      "en": "Separate Cham coastal centers, not uniform continuous independence. The 1190–1220 phase explicitly includes Angkorian occupation and recovery: Smithsonian dates occupation about 1190–1210, while EBSCO dates restored independence to 1220. The northern outline stops before the 1306 O/Ly cession including Hue. After the 1471 loss of Vijaya a southern reference continues; Cham societies and southern polities did not disappear in 1471. The misleading 1400 donor with Hue is withheld.",
      "zh": "占人沿海诸中心，不表示持续独立或均匀控制。1190—1220年分期明确包含吴哥占领及复国：史密森将占领约定于1190—1210年，EBSCO将恢复独立定于1220年。北部轮廓在1306年包括顺化在内的乌、里割地前截止。1471年毗阇耶失陷后仍显示南部参照；占人社群及南部政体未于1471年消失。不采用仍含顺化的误导性1400年来源。"
    },
    "bagan": {
      "en": "The central-plain phase precedes the imperial phase under Anawrahta from 1044. The 1200 reference explicitly combines the source Bagan polygon with the central plain mislabeled Pyu state: UNESCO dates the Pyu city-state phase to about 200 BCE–900 CE and Bagan imperial influence to the eleventh–thirteenth centuries. All source vertices are retained. The imperial reference stops before 1287; the anachronistic 1300/1400 Pagan repetitions are withheld.",
      "zh": "中部平原分期先于1044年阿奴律陀起的帝国分期。1200年参照明确合并来源中蒲甘轮廓与误标为Pyu state的中部平原：联合国教科文组织将骠城邦时期约定于公元前200年至公元900年，蒲甘帝国影响为十一至十三世纪。保留全部来源顶点。帝国参照在1287年前截止，不采用原资料1300／1400年不合时序的蒲甘重复轮廓。"
    },
    "sukhothai": {
      "en": "A claimed regional network, including dependent or contested centers; the source does not prove uniform administration. The selected mature phase stops before reduced regional importance circa 1320, not at the extinction of Sukhothai. Later Ayutthaya suzerainty (1378) and annexation (1438) need separate phases; the 1400 independent-empire donor is withheld.",
      "zh": "此为声称联系的区域网络，包括附属或争夺中的中心，来源不证明均匀行政。所选盛期在约1320年区域影响缩减前截止，并非素可泰消失之年。后来的阿瑜陀耶宗主权（1378年）及兼并（1438年）需另分期；不采用原资料1400年的独立帝国轮廓。"
    },
    "ayutthaya": {
      "en": "The first reference begins with the documented 1351 foundation. The later source stops before the 1569 Toungoo occupation. The Smithsonian dates occupation to 1569–1581; restoration dates vary with the event being dated. This batch leaves 1569–1599 unresolved instead of pretending the prewar outline remained an independent state. Existing seventeenth-century references resume from 1600.",
      "zh": "首个参照始于有记载的1351年建立；后期来源在1569年东吁占领前截止。史密森将占领定于1569—1581年，复国年代随所指事件而有差别。此批保留1569—1599年缺口，不假定战前轮廓仍为独立国家；已有十七世纪参照自1600年恢复。"
    }
  },
